"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[67,66,57,54,25,68],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1015005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,66,57,54,25,68],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1015005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,66,57,54,25,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1015005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,66,57,54,25,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1015005","helmet":"WP1024605","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"西晋时期慕容部鲜卑首领慕容涉归之弟。太康四年十二月，其兄慕容涉归去世，慕容耐违背父死子继的传统篡夺首领之位。为巩固权力多次策划刺杀嫡侄慕容廆，迫使其逃亡辽东。篡位及追杀行径导致部众离心，太康五年十二月被部众杀死。随后慕容廆被迎回继位。","tc":"西晉時期慕容部鮮卑首領慕容涉歸之弟。太康四年十二月，其兄慕容涉歸去世，慕容耐違背父死子繼的傳統篡奪首領之位。為鞏固權力多次策劃刺殺嫡侄慕容廆，迫使其逃亡遼東。篡位及追殺行徑導致部眾離心，太康五年十二月被部眾殺死。隨后慕容廆被迎回繼位。","en":"The younger brother of Murong Shegui, chieftain of the Murong Xianbei during the Western Jin dynasty. In the twelfth month of the fourth year of Taikang, following the death of his elder brother Murong Shegui, Murong Nai usurped the chieftainship in defiance of the tradition of father-to-son succession. To consolidate his power, he plotted numerous assassination attempts against his nephew Murong Hui, forcing him to flee to Liaodong. His usurpation and persecution alienated his tribesmen. In the twelfth month of the fifth year of Taikang, he was slain by his own people. Murong Hui was subsequently welcomed back to succeed him.","jp":"西晋時代の鮮卑慕容部の首領・慕容渉帰の弟。太康4年12月、兄の慕容渉帰が死去すると、慕容耐は父死子継の伝統に背いて首領の座を簒奪した。権力を固めるため、嫡姪の慕容廆の暗殺を幾度も企て、遼東への逃走を余儀なくさせた。だが、簒奪と追殺の行いによって部衆の離反を招き、太康5年12月に部衆によって殺害された。その後、慕容廆が迎え戻されて跡を継いだ。","kr":"서진 시기 모용부 선비의 수령 모용섭귀의 아우이다. 태강 4년 12월, 형 모용섭귀가 세상을 떠나자 모용내는 부자상속의 전통을 어기고 수령의 자리를 찬탈했다. 권력을 공고히 하고자 적조카 모용외를 수차례 암살하려 획책하여 요동으로 달아나게 만들었다. 찬탈과 추살 행각으로 인해 부중의 민심을 잃었으며, 태강 5년 12월에 부중에게 살해당했다. 이후 모용외가 다시 옹립되어 뒤를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1046415","remark":"普武","surname":"慕容","surnameTc":"慕容","surnameEn":"Murong","surnameJp":"慕容","surnameKr":"모용","surnameOther":"","name":"耐","nameTc":"耐","nameEn":"Nai","nameJp":"耐","nameKr":"내","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"慕容耐","power":"WJ10377","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"242","city":"CS1076","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"66","wise":"57","politics":"54","charm":"25","will":"68","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"33/38/28/66/36/32/33/39","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1001405;S1003705","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"3400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010301;1001005;1001715","professions":"2/3/3/3/0/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/2/1/2/0/3/1/0/0/0/2/4/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/